  "cause": {
    "corrective_workstream": "C8 successor after native Homebrew dependency tree size-bound correction",
    "kind": "terminal-campaign-with-verified-partial-publications",
    "summary": "The exact terminal campaign verified 40 of 41 wasm32 tasks; ruby/wasm32 run 31017507098 failed because authenticated LLVM 22.1.8 expanded to 2,624,809,107 regular-file bytes, above the 2 GiB native-keg aggregate. Kandelo commit 75885de70c80448f08600b31a9466608e369713c raises only each native tool keg and its exact target-Cellar proxy to a 4 GiB aggregate while preserving the 1 GiB per-file and existing target dependency, recipe source, and recipe output limits."
